For each of Villagers in the Village, write one line with the selected group in format "<name>: <group>". The group must be one of "farm", "cave", "spawn farmer", "spawn warrior".

For each of Villagers in the Cave, write one line with the selected group in format "<name>: <group>". The group must be one of "attack", "cave", "village".


